{"words": [{"text": "وَهُوَ", "translation": "And He"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "translation": "(is) the One Who"}, {"text": "يُرْسِلُ", "translation": "sends"}, {"text": "ٱلرِّيَـٰحَ", "translation": "the winds"}, {"text": "بُشْرًۢا", "translation": "(as) glad tidings"}, {"text": "بَيْنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "يَدَىْ", "translation": "before"}, {"text": "رَحْمَتِهِۦ ۖ", "translation": "His Mercy"}, {"text": "حَتَّىٰٓ", "translation": "until"}, {"text": "إِذَآ", "translation": "when"}, {"text": "أَقَلَّتْ", "translation": "they have carried"}, {"text": "سَحَابًۭا", "translation": "clouds "}, {"text": "ثِقَالًۭا", "translation": "heavy"}, {"text": "سُقْنَـٰهُ", "translation": "We drive them"}, {"text": "لِبَلَدٍۢ", "translation": "to a land"}, {"text": "مَّيِّتٍۢ", "translation": "dead"}, {"text": "فَأَنزَلْنَا", "translation": "then We send down"}, {"text": "بِهِ", "translation": "from it"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَآءَ", "translation": "the water"}, {"text": "فَأَخْرَجْنَا", "translation": "then We bring forth"}, {"text": "بِهِۦ", "translation": "from it"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "(of)"}, {"text": "كُلِّ", "translation": "all (kinds)"}, {"text": "ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ ۚ", "translation": "(of) fruits"}, {"text": "كَذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "Thus"}, {"text": "نُخْرِجُ", "translation": "We will bring forth"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ", "translation": "the dead"}, {"text": "لَعَلَّكُمْ", "translation": "so that you may"}, {"text": "تَذَكَّرُونَ", "translation": "take heed"}], "sahih": "And it is He who sends the winds as good tidings before His mercy [i.e., rainfall] until, when they have carried heavy rainclouds, We drive them to a dead land and We send down rain therein and bring forth thereby [some] of all the fruits. Thus will We bring forth the dead; perhaps you may be reminded."}